Description: An implementation of Lind and Mehlum's (2010) <doi:10.1111/j.1468-0084.2009.00569.x> Utest to test for the presence of a U shaped or inverted U shaped relationship between 
              variables in (generalized) linear models. It also implements a test of upward/downward sloping relationships at the lower and upper 
              boundary of the data range.
